Date: Sat, 3 Oct 2026 14:52:59 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 2/9] Add D3D12 GPU time profiler (--d3d12_gpu_profile)

Timestamp queries split each submission into guest draws, render target
ownership transfers, resolves, texture loads and swap, and the totals are
logged per frame every 2 seconds. Used to find that EDRAM transfers take
~70% of GPU time with the RTV path at 2x resolution scale.

